{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "b546f58c00844dad64c26e629f80d30ec5d6bdb6e819e0645330dc18edad8511", "ja": "アイドルズ・イン・ハリウッド", "zh": "好莱坞偶像", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "096df72c86dba934302d15a36fb3394873ee592b9d14bf1c17c3d14ca5b4293f", "ja": "ハリウッドに到着した奈緒、海美、\n茜、千早。エンターテインメントの\n本場に、ワクワクが隠せない一同。", "zh": "抵达好莱坞的奈绪、海美、\n茜和千早。来到娱乐业的发源地，\n大家都难掩兴奋之情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2f0b32ed2979f3739af97417f1f6a97a1d5691f2811a63752e9d279de991da32", "ja": "（奈緒たちは、そろそろ空港に着いた頃かな？\n一応、連絡しておこうか）", "zh": "（奈绪她们差不多该到机场了吧？还是联系一下比较好）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "8e6a4db7fdeb645b4ce5dc5e35dbf8aab645b741606e0c99b6ddd7fee64822f5", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nナイスタイミング、ちょうど飛行機乗るとこですよ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n来得正是时候，我们正好要登机呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "207ce63c38e2c18042b37c9c95f26d6c4828e2285d1b7315248548c209467141", "ja": "「お、そうか……フライト、10時間くらいかかる\nらしいな。大変だろうけど、よろしく頼むよ」", "zh": "「哦，这样啊……飞行时间好像要花上10个小时\n左右呢。虽然会很辛苦，不过就拜托你了」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "0b6435bcf9ea93104f99c8e5f1eaf6c5c1e92d26aa102f4e78ed54e6627e2f16", "ja": "そんなん、なんでもないです！　めっちゃワクワク\nしてますから。だってハリウッドやで、ハリウッド！", "zh": "这点小事，没什么啦！我可是超级期待的。因为那可是好莱坞啊，好莱坞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "9960fd588f71c2108c1f6e7afb3af2973976b18776c821cb1d49799aca2cef66", "ja": "そうよね。エンターテイメントの本場、ハリウッドで\nイベントや配信ができるなんて、夢みたいだもの。", "zh": "是啊。在娱乐业的圣地好莱坞举办活动、进行直播，简直像做梦一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "b93f59c97a6acfb7d7ded9bd1aeef93e646fe979332c3c6cc6a8c8a0f023b021", "ja": "ほんとそうっ！　私、昨日はウズウズしちゃって\nぜんぜん眠れなかった～！　おめめパッチリ☆", "zh": "真的就是这样！我昨天兴奋得坐立不安，完全睡不着——！眼睛睁得大大的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "b14807a75fedfa66c29b4d18ea36827b31be3ad08a9f181e4caf0238e831b84f", "ja": "ハリウッドでやりたいこと、たくさんあるー！\n千早さん、写真たくさん撮ってねっ☆", "zh": "我在好莱坞想做的事情可多啦——！\n千早姐，要帮我多拍些照片哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "1c956a35d028df18b22685b50d7fe67563d5909fa09c56d00bc6d1650c5cb0b0", "ja": "ええ、もちろん。ふふっ！\nいい写真がたくさん撮れそうね。", "zh": "嗯，当然。呵呵！\n感觉能拍到很多好照片呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "dec85aca1db6e10f6fa38cca78598229b48550cf139c8c520d835253ebef0b75", "ja": "茜ちゃんも、全然眠れなかった！　というか、むしろ\n寝ずに作業があってね。ふっふっふ……！", "zh": "小茜也完全睡不着！不如说，还得熬夜工作呢。嘿嘿嘿……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "20a35b0eaf971f8ef19428e0c66fc53686a22ae0d04e208fafdbcbc340bb6a86", "ja": "「茜？　また何か企んでるんじゃ……」", "zh": "「茜？你该不会又在盘算什么吧……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "9bf2d2016e31a1034fb96b40787b7b7c5f588c9c424d0f3bb68f8e745ec77e2f", "ja": "人聞きが悪いニャー。ただちょっと、茜ちゃん人形の\n販路を広げるための下準備をね？　ニャーッハッハ！", "zh": "这话说得我好像很坏似的喵。只是为了拓宽小茜玩偶的\n销路，先做点准备而已喵？喵哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "67932436c2dc7e3e27c4a1e1b3ee9a46c5f9bbe68bcd5a24dd43e945344750d1", "ja": "（やれやれ、茜だけちょっと方向性が違うけど……\nとにかく、みんなやる気満々だ。頼もしい限りだな！）", "zh": "（真是的，虽然只有茜的方向有点不一样……总之，大家都干劲十足。真是可靠啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
